cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript and this repository."
title: "CeD-hypothyroidism shared genetics analysis code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Jiating"
  - family-names: "Tong"
    given-names: "Shuangshuang"
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Zheng"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Seronion/CeD-hypothyroidism-shared-genetics"
url: "https://github.com/Seronion/CeD-hypothyroidism-shared-genetics"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for cross-trait genomic analyses of celiac disease and hypothyroidism,
  including genome-wide genetic sharing, local covariance, shared-locus discovery,
  colocalization, tissue enrichment, transcriptome-integrated analyses, and bidirectional
  Mendelian randomization.
keywords:
  - celiac disease
  - hypothyroidism
  - GWAS
  - genetic correlation
  - polygenic overlap
  - colocalization
  - Mendelian randomization
